Package: svichurn
Title: Decision Churn of Thresholded Composite Indices Under Sampling Error
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Brendan", "Lam", email = "brendannathanlam@hotmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Propagates survey sampling error, represented by replicate
    estimates, through a composite index that is normalised, weighted,
    summed and thresholded, and reports for each unit the probability of
    leaving or entering the funded set. Ships an exact implementation of the
    Centers for Disease Control and Prevention / Agency for Toxic Substances
    and Disease Registry Social Vulnerability Index 2022 aggregation rule.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/blam3/composite-indices-as-policies
